OL,3,GNEWSA'Hospital discharge scheme put me
OL,4,Aon my own two feet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of patients have been able to
OL,7,Fleave hospital more quickly thanks to a
OL,8,Fnew service to free up beds occupied by
OL,9,Fpeople who are ready to go home.
OL,11,FThe Home First model run by Kent
OL,12,FCommunity NHS Trust (KCT) has helped
OL,13,Fmore than 2,250 patients return home
OL,14,Fwith support since it began earlier
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,17,FBob and Irene Hills, from Paddock Wood,
OL,18,Fboth spent time in hospital this summer
OL,19,Fand said the support they received had
OL,20,Fallowed them to return home quickly.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
